Chapter: CapOutsideVocabulary

 The capability vocabulary is derived in Foreword chapter Capability --
 eighteen rows plus a dotted Read and Write for the three families that
 carry a direction, giving twenty-four admissible names. An effect row
 naming anything else has no manifest entry that could carry it, no boot
 grant that could expand it and no policy that could cover it, so the
 type checker refuses the program rather than emitting a binary whose
 manifest silently omits an authority the source asked for.

Section: Definitions

  opening : [Audit] Integer
  opening = act
   0
